Z||000003||DaRkLoRD||08-02-2000||03:49 PM||||RSM sells the side scoops you're looking for.<BR> <A HREF="http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1" TARGET=_blank>http://webhome.idirect.com/~rsm1</A> <BR>So does the Fiero Shop (Race Tech)<BR> <A HREF="http://www.thefieroshop.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.thefieroshop.com</A> ,<BR>Fiero Store, and a couple of others.<P>unless you mean a Holley-style scoop.. you can get one of those from Tom for $30:<P> <A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com/tom" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com/tom</A> <P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A> <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
